WEBVTT

01:35.360 --> 01:36.490
Neo-Saitama.

01:36.490 --> 01:39.370
The NEKOSOGI Fund, inside the Tokorozawa Tower.

01:36.490 --> 01:39.370
NOTE: The NEKOSOGI Fund funds NEKOSOGI.

01:39.370 --> 01:42.410
This is the main base of the SŌKAIYA SYNDICATE.

01:42.950 --> 01:44.910
Release the lions.

01:56.590 --> 01:59.260
Only clones can act in such perfect unity.

01:59.260 --> 02:01.510
These Y-12s are invincible.

02:01.510 --> 02:04.720
Then release Huge SHURIKEN.

02:07.310 --> 02:09.600
GUWAAAAH!

02:11.730 --> 02:13.230
EEYAHH!

02:13.650 --> 02:16.400
MWAHAHAA!

02:16.400 --> 02:18.240
STRIKE!

02:18.240 --> 02:21.320
L-Laomoto-SAN, I'm terribly sorry!

02:21.320 --> 02:23.660
If our soldiers were stronger than our NINJA,

02:23.660 --> 02:27.460
there's no telling when they'd turn on us, right?

02:27.460 --> 02:31.580
You people at Yoroshisan have done it again.

02:32.750 --> 02:36.880
But you've made a mess on my office's floor.

02:36.880 --> 02:38.420
And for that, you must die.

02:39.720 --> 02:43.260
AIYYEEEEEEHH!

02:44.430 --> 02:46.970
Now then, Huge SHURIKEN.

02:46.970 --> 02:50.190
I have two enemies right now:

02:50.190 --> 02:54.020
NINJA Slayer and Dragon DŌJŌ.

02:54.400 --> 02:59.280
You will join Earthquake and set fire to Dragon DŌJŌ.

02:59.280 --> 03:01.240
With pleasure!

03:02.530 --> 03:05.280
SURPRISED DOJO

03:05.740 --> 03:08.750
Chūgoku, in Northern Saitama.

03:09.160 --> 03:13.210
Do you know where Dragon DŌJŌ is?

03:13.210 --> 03:16.130
|f you don't tell me, then first I'll break your pinkie!

03:16.130 --> 03:18.260
Please don't! I don't know!

03:19.090 --> 03:19.630
YEEART!

03:19.630 --> 03:21.090
AIYEEH!

03:21.090 --> 03:23.680
Next, I'll break your ring finger!

03:23.680 --> 03:24.800
Please don't!

03:24.800 --> 03:25.720
I don't know!

03:25.720 --> 03:26.310
YEEART!

03:26.310 --> 03:27.720
AIYEEH!

03:27.720 --> 03:30.310
Next I'll break your middle finger!

03:30.310 --> 03:32.400
Please don't! I don't know!

03:32.400 --> 03:33.020
YEEART!

03:33.020 --> 03:34.360
AIYEEH!

03:34.360 --> 03:37.170
Next I'll break your index finger!

03:37.170 --> 03:38.110
Please don't!

03:38.110 --> 03:39.780
I really don't know!

03:39.780 --> 03:40.360
YEEART!

03:40.360 --> 03:43.660
AIYYEEEEEEHH!

03:44.870 --> 03:47.870
Huge, your interview is over.

03:47.870 --> 03:53.920
KIRISUTE

03:48.240 --> 03:51.410
Hellkite-SAN sent us his scouting information.

03:51.410 --> 03:53.920
He says he's found Dragon DŌJŌ.

03:54.250 --> 03:56.290
That stupid bat bastard.

03:56.290 --> 03:58.840
He's trying to suck up to the bosses again?

03:58.840 --> 03:59.340
Huh?

04:03.090 --> 04:06.800
My creative, original tortures were just getting started!

04:15.310 --> 04:16.690
He's taking too long.

04:16.690 --> 04:19.480
Is he trying to test my patience?

04:19.900 --> 04:21.780
But time's up.

04:21.780 --> 04:24.780
The PLAN cannot be allowed to fall behind.

04:31.250 --> 04:32.710
Who did this to you?

04:32.710 --> 04:34.830
NINJA Slayer!

04:34.830 --> 04:35.920
He's following me!

04:36.420 --> 04:41.010
NINJA Slayer! Why is he—

04:45.180 --> 04:47.430
He's insane!

04:47.430 --> 04:49.560
He's a rabid dog!

04:49.560 --> 04:52.890
EARTH! Go faster!

04:49.560 --> 04:52.890
NOTE: EARTH is the third planet of the SOLAR SYSTEM.

04:52.890 --> 04:54.270
He's coming

04:54.600 --> 05:00.440
<i>He can still fight, but it'll be hard for him to remain a member of the SIX GATES.</i>

05:00.440 --> 05:04.320
<i>I don't understand why NINJA Slayer is here!</i>

05:04.320 --> 05:06.490
<i>Coincidence? Or is he trying to stop us?</i>

05:06.490 --> 05:10.030
<i>Or is there some relationship between the two of them?</i>

05:10.790 --> 05:12.330
Danger! Danger!

05:10.790 --> 05:12.330
Danger

05:14.750 --> 05:15.830
It's him!

05:17.790 --> 05:21.250
DŌMO, Huge SHURIKEN-SAN. Earthquake-SAN.

05:21.800 --> 05:23.420
I am NINJA Slayer.

05:23.920 --> 05:27.010
Answer me! Why do you seek Dragon DŌJŌ?

05:27.010 --> 05:28.890
Fool! Why would we tell you?

05:28.890 --> 05:30.260
Then you will be slain!

05:30.260 --> 05:31.100
YEEART!

05:37.600 --> 05:39.810
You made it in time, Hellkite-SAN!

05:39.810 --> 05:42.440
Nobody asked for your help...

05:46.490 --> 05:49.450
HELLKITE-SAN, WHERE IS THE DOJO?

05:49.450 --> 05:51.450
JUST KEEP GOING NORTH

05:49.450 --> 05:51.450
GONNA STAB YOU WITH A SPEAR

05:51.910 --> 05:54.160
They have no need for words.

05:54.160 --> 05:56.410
Built into their Harley

05:56.410 --> 06:02.420
is a secured, powerful IRC terminal from Omura Industries.

06:14.810 --> 06:20.100
This is the master of Dragon DŌJŌ, and Japan's last REAL NINJA.

06:14.810 --> 06:20.100
NOTE: REAL NINJAS practice ACTUAL NINJUTSU.

06:20.100 --> 06:22.230
Dragon Gendōsō!

06:25.530 --> 06:28.990
This is Dragon Gendōsō's granddaughter.

06:28.990 --> 06:31.530
She is the young, delicate Yukano.

06:31.530 --> 06:34.240
Yukano's BUST is VOLUPTUOUS.

06:35.240 --> 06:39.040
<i>So NINJA Slayer-SAN never came, huh?</i>

06:39.040 --> 06:41.960
<i>But perhaps that's for the best.</i>

06:43.540 --> 06:46.300
Let no intruders survive!

06:46.300 --> 06:47.260
HAI!

06:50.180 --> 06:53.100
DŌMO, Dragon Gendōsō-SAN.

06:53.100 --> 06:55.850
We are the SŌKAI SIX GATES.

06:55.850 --> 06:58.680
We have come to set fire to Dragon DŌJŌ.

06:59.390 --> 07:03.270
DŌMŌ, SŌKAI SIX GATES-SAN.

07:03.270 --> 07:05.520
I am Dragon Gendōsō.

07:05.520 --> 07:07.320
You are Laomoto Khan's—

07:07.320 --> 07:08.070
YEEART!

07:09.780 --> 07:11.070
NAMU AMIDA BUTSU!

07:11.070 --> 07:12.490
How cowardly!

07:15.740 --> 07:17.200
YEEART!

07:19.080 --> 07:20.000
Don't!

07:20.000 --> 07:23.920
As written in the KOJIKI, this is the NINJA attack, formation, YAJIRI.

07:20.000 --> 07:23.920
NOTE: YAJIRI means ARROW made of NINJAS.

07:23.920 --> 07:26.500
An unbelievably powerful assault formation!

07:26.840 --> 07:27.420
But...

07:27.420 --> 07:28.920
YEAARGGGH!

07:29.220 --> 07:32.970
That was just what Huge SHURIKEN wanted!

07:33.300 --> 07:35.260
Nice backup, Huge!

07:41.850 --> 07:42.770
A foolish error!

07:46.020 --> 07:49.650
Gendōsō-SAN, cease your resistance and surrender.

07:49.650 --> 07:52.950
Or there's no telling what will happen to this girl!

07:59.160 --> 08:01.460
NINJA Slayer-SAN!

08:01.460 --> 08:03.460
Wait, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

08:03.460 --> 08:05.170
Don't you care about this gir—

08:05.170 --> 08:06.500
SATSUBATSU!

08:06.960 --> 08:10.550
Fujikido has been taken over by the SOUL of NARAKU NINJA,

08:10.550 --> 08:13.470
who wishes to slay all NINJAS!

08:13.470 --> 08:17.140
What happened to him after his defeat on the highway?

08:17.890 --> 08:21.730
To find out, we must go back in time...

08:22.850 --> 08:25.730
Pathetic.

08:25.730 --> 08:28.440
Leave everything to me.

08:28.440 --> 08:30.570
With my DARK KARATE,

08:30.570 --> 08:35.490
I'll slay all of those SŌKAI NINJA!

08:35.490 --> 08:36.780
NAMU SAN!

08:36.780 --> 08:38.530
What a tragedy!

08:38.530 --> 08:41.410
Fujikido cared so much for the two who saved his life

08:41.410 --> 08:45.500
that he succumbed to NARAKU NINJA'S cunning words!

08:47.500 --> 08:49.000
YEEART!!

08:50.250 --> 08:52.090
Splendid!

08:52.090 --> 08:54.630
You have done well to rely on me!

08:54.630 --> 08:57.800
But I won't stop with the three SŌKAI NINJA.

08:57.800 --> 09:02.270
I'll slay every NINJA at Dragon DŌJŌ!

09:10.150 --> 09:11.440
HWAAHH!

09:11.440 --> 09:13.190
GWUUUARRGH!

09:13.780 --> 09:15.820
Yukano, run!

09:23.200 --> 09:24.500
YEEART!

09:27.170 --> 09:30.630
The red light in his eyes disappeared,
and he wept tears of blood!

09:30.630 --> 09:35.170
The cries of Yukano and Gendōsō awoke Fujikido's mind!

09:35.670 --> 09:37.970
But it's too late!

09:37.970 --> 09:39.800
It wasn't supposed to be this way!

09:39.800 --> 09:41.260
YEEART!

09:41.260 --> 09:43.060
EYYAAGGGH!

09:44.470 --> 09:46.980
I tried to kill the people I must protect...

09:46.980 --> 09:50.820
Have my body and mind become that of a NINJA?

09:50.820 --> 09:54.240
Like the NINJA who killed my wife and child?

09:54.240 --> 09:57.240
NAMU SAN! Is this the end?

09:57.240 --> 09:58.910
Then I shall die!

09:58.910 --> 10:00.240
l want a FUTON.

10:00.240 --> 10:02.200
If I could commit SEPUKU, I would!

10:00.240 --> 10:02.200
NOTE: SEPUKU is NINJA HARAKIRI.

10:02.200 --> 10:04.750
Rise, NINJA Slayer-SAN

10:05.120 --> 10:06.330
Gendōsō-SAN!

10:06.750 --> 10:08.000
You senile old fool!

10:08.000 --> 10:10.580
The age of REAL NINJA is over!

10:15.130 --> 10:18.050
Listen well, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:18.050 --> 10:20.640
You must not fight power with power!

10:20.640 --> 10:22.470
This is INSTRUCTION ONE!

10:22.470 --> 10:24.970
Move as I do!

10:25.600 --> 10:26.390
YEEART!!

10:28.390 --> 10:31.270
Here we go, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

10:31.270 --> 10:32.360
YEEART!

10:35.480 --> 10:36.240
HUWARGGH!

10:36.240 --> 10:39.110
EYAAAGGH!

10:39.110 --> 10:42.580
Listen well! This is the secret of INSTRUCTION ONE!

10:42.580 --> 10:45.580
If an enemy cannot be defeated by a hundred SURIKEN,

10:45.580 --> 10:48.000
you must not rely on a single strike!

10:48.330 --> 10:50.750
You must instead throw one thousand SURIKEN!

10:51.000 --> 10:54.460
Hellkite-SAN's reinforcements aren't here yet!

10:54.460 --> 10:56.510
What's taking him so long!?

10:56.510 --> 10:59.510
Huge, get up!

10:59.510 --> 11:02.220
YEEART!

11:04.140 --> 11:06.560
DRAGON TOBIGERI!

11:06.560 --> 11:08.520
GUWAAAAARRRGGGHH!

11:08.770 --> 11:09.980
SAYŌNARA!

11:14.020 --> 11:17.740
Well done You have passed the test of INSTRUCTION ONE.

11:17.740 --> 11:21.110
Why did you save me twice?

11:21.610 --> 11:26.910
Today, I saw a pitch-black shadow and a golden light in your SOUL.

11:26.910 --> 11:32.830
You carry a noble SOUL, which is fated to rise to the top of KINKAKU TEMPLE.

11:26.910 --> 11:32.830
NOTE: KINKAKU TEMPLE is the KINKAKU-JI

11:32.830 --> 11:35.000
I shall lead you there!

11:35.710 --> 11:36.840
SENSEI!

11:42.130 --> 11:43.180
A blowgun!

11:43.180 --> 11:46.220
Huge SHURIKEN was still alive!

11:46.640 --> 11:52.060
TAKEUCHI, an anti-NINJA virus secretly developed by Yoroshisan Pharmaceuticals,

11:52.060 --> 11:56.900
mercilessly invaded the body of Japan's last REAL NINJA.

11:57.650 --> 11:58.570
Curse you!

11:58.570 --> 12:00.030
Huge SHURIKEN-SAN!

12:00.030 --> 12:01.650
How dare you do that to my SENSEI?

12:02.320 --> 12:05.950
Damn it! I couldn't even get a spare?

12:05.950 --> 12:09.660
You used me as a decoy, EARTH, and this is what you get!

12:09.660 --> 12:11.620
I'll see you in hell!

12:17.540 --> 12:21.220
NINJA Slayer-SAN, run!

12:21.220 --> 12:23.260
GUWARRGGH!

12:23.260 --> 12:25.390
Follow me!

12:42.360 --> 12:43.740
The DŌJŌ!

12:46.160 --> 12:49.330
A megaton-class tactical nuclear weapon!

12:49.330 --> 12:51.330
The BANZAI NUKE!

12:51.750 --> 12:53.750
Run, NINJA Slayer!

12:53.750 --> 12:55.080
Run!

12:55.540 --> 13:01.510
But the exhaustion from his continued battles had pushed his body to the limit.
